		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>通信『聞こえたぞ……
[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]　どうした……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
